  <uml:Package xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499774143838_799754_29773" xmi:uuid="e521c251-b0b9-45fd-8366-ee0af1d48e6e" xmi:type="uml:Package">
    <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1510149874015_950313_31108" xmi:uuid="7c26a521-860e-4b58-93fc-c4b5ae91aba9" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
      <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499774143838_799754_29773"/>
      <body>This capability provides the ability to identify the shape and structure of composite structural materials and to represent chemical composition of, the non uniform, typically directional material properties of, and surface characteristics of composite products. The figure below provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;Composite_domainModel_Overview.png&lt;/name&gt;Simplified overview of the AP242 composite Domain model&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
    </ownedComment>
    <name>CompositeStructuralShapeAndStructure</name>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194089_845071_29051" xmi:uuid="01e12359-7557-4dee-a715-3afcb1637970" xmi:type="uml:Association">
