        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193249_952242_23850"/>
        <body>A SmearedMaterial is a type of ZoneStructuralMakeup that provides the material properties for an idealized zone or area of a part. &lt;note&gt;A SmearedMaterial can represent the material properties of a single StockMaterial by having the PercentageLaminateTable reference one StockMaterial and set its percent value of that materials constituent to 100%.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>SmearedMaterial</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194066_968505_28954" xmi:uuid="299a10d1-6483-4def-b03c-e9cf9aacdc1f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
