          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193516_904119_25580"/>
          <body> specifies the geometric model used to represent the shape of the CompositeAssembly. The shape shall be one of the CompositeAssemblyShapeSelect entities. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
