        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193268_369215_23878"/>
        <body>A ThreeDGeometrySet is a type of ConstituentShapeRepresentation that defines 3D boundary curve and surface geometry without topology. The surfaces used in the representation have a defined model surface context.</body>
