        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193183_422366_23742"/>
        <body>A PlyLaminateTable is a type of LaminateTable that provides an ordered list of Ply objects. The ordered list provides basic placement position within the laminate (see following figure). &lt;note&gt; The valid components of a PlyLaminateTable are plies only. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;note&gt; The PlyLaminateTable is only valid to describe a LaminateTable. &lt;/note&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;PlyLaminateTable.png&lt;/name&gt;Ply laminate table&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PlyLaminateTable</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193798_747770_27620" xmi:uuid="b8e1f75b-f707-4599-940a-e64b3d5cdeb9" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
