          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193913_989240_28237"/>
          <body> specifies an ordered list of Ply sets that make up the PlyLaminate. There shall be not less than two PlyLaminateSequenceDefinition for the PlyLaminateTable.</body>
        </ownedComment>
