    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197790420_220072_96842" xmi:uuid="3cda8395-c468-466f-939e-8ffd016124e5" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8f101ed_1540971036777_587783_103277" xmi:uuid="e05d8a9c-2a75-4c18-89a8-7da72c2b3c4e" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197790420_220072_96842"/>
        <body>A PointArray is a type of DetailedGeometricModelElement. A PointArray is a list of points and directions specifying the fiber orientations for a Ply (see Figure below). &lt;note&gt;The ply 11 and 22 directions are known only at the points of the PointArray. If the ply orientations need to be known in-between them a suitable interpolation scheme, such as spline surfaces, should be used. &lt;/note&gt; &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;Point_array.gif&lt;/name&gt;Point array&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PointArray</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533199550551_657683_97576" xmi:uuid="22a67231-948b-461e-9c8b-943178af1ce9" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
