        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193184_535962_23747"/>
        <body>A PointOnCurve is a type of Point that characterizes a point which lies on a curve. It results from the evaluation of the function that defines the Curve with a particular parameter. </body>
      </ownedComment>
