    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533198061348_883450_96896" xmi:uuid="500cbcd2-0bbd-4b73-af3d-8e9d7e329793" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1536312146770_342120_96532" xmi:uuid="d2c9a173-4b9e-4a9f-a70f-53c33969ba4f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533198061348_883450_96896"/>
        <body>A Polar11 is a type of DetailedGeometricModelItem whose 11 component specifies the basis for the orientation angle of the major fiber direction, commonly known as a Rosette. The Polar11 is defined by a Cartesian coordinate frame at the apex of a spherical surface (see Figure below). The basis 11 direction is always in the radial direction from the center, or apex, of the part. When the Polar_11 Rosette mapping takes place, the direction of the 0° orientation is pointing outward in a radial direction. No guide curve is required. The PlyOrientationAngle is with respect to the plane tangent to the BaseSurface of the LaminateTable with the 33 direction parallel to the outward normal of the BaseSurface. A Polar11 is an AxisPlacement that is referenced by the ReinforcementOrientationBasis of a PlyOrientationAngle. There shall exist one AxisPlacement for a Polar11. &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;Polar_11.gif&lt;/name&gt;Polar11&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Polar11</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533199556663_751874_97579" xmi:uuid="717542ee-877d-4b91-9014-173811118ebc" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533199424732_629000_97522"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533198188610_485952_96949" xmi:uuid="fc214788-f227-4ebf-8dcb-48d84254465d" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general href="../RepresentationAndExternalElementReference/RepresentationAndExternalElementReference.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193072_543741_23516"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533198127009_960651_96939" xmi:uuid="91d3e421-9e38-4f38-b3a0-a55fb09cfb38" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1536312255893_847851_96533" xmi:uuid="4461f666-2197-40a8-9f47-f8e3e6fbb51f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533198127009_960651_96939"/>
          <body> the 11 component of a Cartesian coordinate frame specifying the 11 or primary fiber direction. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>Placement</name>
