          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193915_683152_28250"/>
          <body> specifies the shape representation that the PlyShape is derived from or that is used as its basis of definition. The value of this attribute need not be specified.</body>
        </ownedComment>
