        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1536246160083_627052_94575" xmi:uuid="a0a0da15-3f6e-4066-844b-3a93933aec2d" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533224441512_119964_98996"/>
          <body>the geometric elements which make up the GeometricSet, these may be Points, Curves or Surfaces; but are required to be of the same coordinate space dimensionality. </body>
