          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1536311124016_775130_96467"/>
          <body> an attribute inherited from the RepresentationRelationship shall be redeclared as the PlyAngleRepresentation for the PlyOrientationAngle. </body>
        </ownedComment>
