        <body>A ZoneStructuralMakeupShapeRepresentation is the shape of a zone or area of a part. &lt;note&gt;The zone can be a point, a specific area, or the entire part. A ZoneStructuralMakeupShapeRepresentation may be either a PointZoneShape or an EdgeZoneShape.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
