        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193047_851774_23460"/>
        <body>A CompositeAssemblyTable is a type of LaminateTable that provides an ordered list of constituent parts. The ordered list provides basic placement position within the laminate (see following figure). &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;CompositeAssemblyTable.png&lt;/name&gt;Composite assembly table&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>CompositeAssemblyTable</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193517_939720_25594" xmi:uuid="af51ceac-1a33-4df8-beeb-ed4694cb6b7f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
