          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193641_338996_26570"/>
          <body> specifies the geometry that defines the shape of the zone. The boundary shall be one of the BoundaryClassZoneSelect entities.</body>
        </ownedComment>
