            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//PartView[@uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='Ply' ]"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="@uid"/&gt; &lt;sch:let name="unitRef" value="child::PlyThickness/Unit/@uidRef"/&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="//Unit[@uid=$unitRef]/Name/ClassString='length'"&gt;(Ply.WR2 &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid"/&gt;) the unit name for PlyThickness shall be 'length'.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
