        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193219_682367_23805"/>
        <body>A ReinforcementOrientationBasis is the definition of direction defined in terms of a PlyLaminate or CompositeAssembly. It is the basis for interpretation of the fiber orientation within a ply and is commonly known as a rosette.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_271a0567_1545229488503_719612_228516" xmi:uuid="2f6f5f6a-0a39-4034-b243-4cd033e02146" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
