          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417194002_231318_28675"/>
          <body> specifies an inverse relationship that specifies that the existence of the ReinforcementOrientationBasis is dependent on the existence of the LaminateTable that specifies the ReinforcementOrientationBasis as its basis. There shall be one or more LaminateTable for a ReinforcementOrientationBasis.</body>
