    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193082_703003_23531" xmi:uuid="cb6dd810-e844-4679-a837-ee5ad3613044" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454498696176_693975_43204" xmi:uuid="3339b575-7e24-453a-873b-70bf895b35c7" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193082_703003_23531"/>
        <body>A DrapedOrientationAngle is a type of PlyOrientationAngle that defines a position and direction at a point within a part. &lt;note&gt;The warp direction of a fabric shall be placed in the specified direction prior to draping over the part. Once the fabric has been draped, the orientation angle at any given point must be derived from the draped shape of the fabric. The DrapedOrientationAngle will change in the part if the surface of the part has complex curvature.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>DrapedOrientationAngle</name>
