        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454500366191_619790_43293" xmi:uuid="5f11937e-3ec5-4c46-bd0c-1b1828983d32" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193922_12862_28291"/>
          <body> specifies the StockMaterial that is processed to get the ProcessedCore configuration. The types of processes include machining, forming, stabilizing, and bonding.</body>
