    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197528558_778788_96762" xmi:uuid="e51e982c-f72c-4d32-bf41-a2af8bff89b4" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1536245457135_123598_94570" xmi:uuid="2b80d9c0-bfd2-4d8a-a706-4caa7e0d74b0" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197528558_778788_96762"/>
        <body>A Cylindrical11 is a type of DetailedGeometricModelItem that specifies the orientation angle, commonly known as a Rosette, relative to a guide curve (see Figure below). This method of Rosette representation is suitable for cylindrical part types where it is desired for the primary fiber orientation to follow the path of a cylindrical surface. The guide curve is created by the intersection of the cylinder surface with a plane through the centerline of the cylinder. A PlyOrientationAngle Rosette is specified by right hand rule about the 33 direction of the outward facing normal of the plane tangent to the cylindrical BaseSurface of the LaminateTable at an evaluated point on the guide curve. &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;Cylindrical_11.gif&lt;/name&gt;Cylindrical11&lt;/figure&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Cylindrical11</name>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197681886_281901_96812" xmi:uuid="ae115bed-2065-481c-ae76-b273d66afa5f" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general href="../RepresentationAndExternalElementReference/RepresentationAndExternalElementReference.xmi#_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193072_543741_23516"/>
      </generalization>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533199544177_892558_97573" xmi:uuid="bf46efe2-abfa-4973-9d5b-616266c1f566" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533199424732_629000_97522"/>
      </generalization>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197607844_228539_96805" xmi:uuid="58f65de5-fd7c-412c-9299-e567453d1c77" xmi:type="uml:Property">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1536245764059_661143_94571" xmi:uuid="1e313243-4c87-4415-9b30-b602bb453628" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8db01ea_1533197607844_228539_96805"/>
          <body> a curve specifying the 11 or primary fiber direction. A Cylindrical11 is a Curve that is referenced by the ReinforcementOrientationBasis of a PlyOrientationAngle. There shall exist one or many Curve for a Cylindrical11. </body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>GuideCurves</name>
        <visibility>public</visibility>
        <type xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193061_763784_23495"/>
