    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193055_645521_23479" xmi:uuid="e6d83c91-f827-40a9-a225-25a8e579e8de" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454498461723_551297_43194" xmi:uuid="bb43e626-05f5-4d20-9d77-5cfba042d659" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193055_645521_23479"/>
        <body>A ConstituentShapeRepresentation is a type of GeometricRepresentation. It is the shape representation of composite part constituents. A ConstituentShapeRepresentation is one of the following: &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;ThreeDGeometrySet, &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;BeveledSheetRepresentation. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;CompositeSheetRepresentation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>ConstituentShapeRepresentation</name>
