        <annotatedElement href="../../../../SysML_ARM/SYSML_ARM_AP242.xmi#_2_attr_SYSML_ARM-Composite_curve-curve_segment"/>
        <body>Special case: in the Domain model does not contain all the details, thus the External item Reference is used to refer to P21 data in order to retrieve the Composite curve segment information.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_0_5_45e01bd_1454498251682_477575_43189" xmi:uuid="5ac65f8f-3a79-4d21-9453-f9f5981075ed" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193047_229621_23461"/>
        <body>A CompositeCurveOnSurface is a type of Curve that references an instance of type &lt;a&gt;&lt;path&gt;../../../resources/geometry_schema/geometry_schema.htm#geometry_schema.composite_curve_on_surface&lt;/path&gt;composite_curve_on_surface&lt;/a&gt; (ISO 10303-42).</body>
