        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193186_467818_23752"/>
        <body>A PointZoneShape is a type of ZoneStructuralMakeupShapeRepresentation that specifies a point on the surface of a part. It also specifies the singular volume a piercing line would make as it travelled through the part, normal to the part's surface at the point.</body>
      </ownedComment>
